      "writtenOn": "2021-02-26T17:24:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should use the #defines from include/linker/sections.h here.\n\ne.g. _RODATA_SECTION_NAME, _DATA_SECTION_NAME\n\nAlso, can you avoid the ADDR() specifiers?  The address of a section isn\u0027t related to it\u0027s size.\n\n__image_size \u003d SIZEOF(_TEXT_SECTION_NAME) + SIZEOF(.ARM.exidx) + SIZEOF(_RODATA_SECTION_NAME) + SIZEOF(_DATA_SECTION_NAME) + SIZEOF(devices)  + SIZEOF(k_mutex_area)",
      "range": {
