      "writtenOn": "2021-02-26T17:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The address is important because there are a lot of sections between what I\u0027m doing here is basically taking the end of rodata - start of rom_start which gives me the used size of the FLASH (similar to LENGTH(FLASH) in platform/ec/core/cortex-m/ec.lds.S). We can\u0027t use LENGTH(FLASH) because Zephyr doesn\u0027t assume we\u0027ll stick 2 images in there so LENGTH(FLASH) is the size of the whole flash.\n\nI\u0027ve updated:\nrodata -\u003e _RODATA_SECTION_NAME\ndatas  -\u003e _DATA_SECTION_NAME\n\nThe others don\u0027t have an alias and are specific to the cortex_m from what I can tell.",
